  "displayName": "Quad 4.0",
  "family": "quad",
  "description": "Four corner channels at \u00b145\u00b0 (front) and \u00b1135\u00b0 (rear) \u2014 no center, no height. Maps to the four dome quadrants for a classic enveloping square; great for quad music and 4-corner ambience.",
